  <div class="acc rv">
    <div class="acc-i open"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="true">Confirmation<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>After you book, our team reaches out within 24 hours to confirm. Requests aren't guaranteed until confirmed.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Payment &amp; gratuity<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>A credit card holds all group appointments, with a deposit to secure your reservation. The balance is charged on the day of your booking. Advance payment may be required for services totaling $80+ per guest. A 20% gratuity is added to all group bookings, calculated on the full service total, and goes directly to your nail artists.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Cancellation &amp; changes<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>We ask for at least 48 hours' notice for any change, including guest count. With notice, your deposit carries to your new date. Within 48 hours, your deposit is retained. No-shows may be charged up to 50%.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Running late<span class="sg"></span></button>
